{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.poster.avif?t=1770221915\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.webm?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.mp4?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Fish Library</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 522 base designs and more than 4,176 total illustrations to collect and admire.</strong> Every fish is assigned one of seven rarity levels:\u00a0<strong>Common,Uncommon,Rare,Epic,Legendary,Mythic,Ancient</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/86ceeb6fcdb0cf30a7a8436a7dce4a8f.poster.avif?t=1770221915\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/86ceeb6fcdb0cf30a7a8436a7dce4a8f.webm?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/86ceeb6fcdb0cf30a7a8436a7dce4a8f.mp4?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Growth &amp; Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish grow from fry to adult in real time. Sell for instant rewards or keep them for steady passive income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/c976c8769cbc38572ead77b67b151b61.poster.avif?t=1770221915\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/c976c8769cbc38572ead77b67b151b61.webm?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/c976c8769cbc38572ead77b67b151b61.mp4?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Play</strong> <br>Your aquarium thrives even while you work or study. Relax with soothing visuals and gentle ambient sound using auto-feed feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Aquariums</strong> <br>Choose tank styles, day-night cycles, and decorations. Shape your perfect underwater retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/086c38634739e26a53ea93f6d917f9e9.poster.avif?t=1770221915\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/086c38634739e26a53ea93f6d917f9e9.webm?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/086c38634739e26a53ea93f6d917f9e9.mp4?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on global rankings based on your <strong>total fish collection value</strong> or the <strong>number of unique species discovered</strong>. Track your progress and see how your aquarium compares to others worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive In Today</strong><br>Easy Bubbles blends relaxation with endless collecting. Start building your ultimate aquarium sanctuary now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.poster.avif?t=1770221915\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.webm?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.mp4?t=1770221915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Bubbles combines soothing, hands-off gameplay with deep collection mechanics. Whether you\u2019re unwinding after a long day or setting goals to complete your fish library, you\u2019ll find endless delight swimming just beneath the surface. Dive in and start building your dream aquarium today!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Catch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651560/43759f949065d2a67495d8fb8fc70151011b5412.jpg"},{"name":"First Sale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651560/19709ba16ea78ff4ba2f2735000b8a53449469da.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Touch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651560/bb4ae95797e12f732a1805472ca00e064dd044f3.jpg"},{"name":"Rainbow Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651560/fc4b2ff628d370dbd4fff321368d568d48902e60.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651560/b858a2e1fe9d1d77e777a843c3898de31530d5a3.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://